# Compendium packs are LevelDB. CURRENT ends in a single 0x0a and the .log files are framed
# binary records with CRC32C over their own bytes. With core.autocrlf=true and no rule here,
# a fresh clone writes CURRENT as "MANIFEST-000002\r\n", LevelDB never finds the manifest,
# and every pack opens EMPTY in Foundry with no error -- the exact failure the notes already
# warn about, arriving by a route that has nothing to do with how the pack was built.
packs/** binary
